        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 855, 3 Inch Precision Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith transitional style that you'll love, the Precision 3 Inch Cabinet Pull is trending in today's home decor scene. The Precision 3 Inch Pull is available in a few popular finish colors options. This stunning kitchen cabinet pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It has 3 inch mounting centers and is 3.5 inches overall. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Precision\">MNG Precision Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 855 Precision 3 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
